        <mxCell id="future_title" value="🔮 &lt;b&gt;Future: Adaptability Layer&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#F57F17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="975" y="645" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="future_desc" value="&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;After debrief, the system can build a &lt;b&gt;learner model&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Track per-step mastery across sessions&lt;br&gt;• Identify weak protocol areas&lt;br&gt;• Generate next scenario targeting gaps&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Example:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trainee consistently forgets headcount&lt;br&gt;→ next session emphasizes accountability phase&lt;br&gt;→ scenario adds more missing-persons conditions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#F57F17'&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Mentioned as next step in thesis scope)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="975" y="675" width="345" height="220" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

